Excited to announce my commitment to the University of Michigan-Ann Arbor! I‘m very blessed and grateful for this opportunity representing the Wolverine on the course in the Fall 2025. Thank you Coach Dowling @jkdgolf for the trust and the opportunity, I am sure we are going to have a wonderful 4 years together. 

I want to thank my coach Eugene @eugene_lee_golf for taking care of me for the past years, we’ve had a lot of unforgettable memories and up-and-downs together. Of course I will like show gratitude to my family, especially my dad, for all the supports and faith in me. Last but not least, I will like to thank BIBA, my advisor Kai, and all my friends around me. It’s been a wonderful journey for my junior golf career, and I will get ready for the next chapter of my life. Can’t wait. GO BLUE!💙💙💙

